# NumCompute: Streaming Data Processing and Incremental Learning

This notebook demonstrates the streaming capabilities of the NumCompute toolkit developed for Assignment 2.2.

It demonstrates how to:
- Load datasets incrementally using CSV chunks.
- Preprocess data using streaming preprocessing techniques.
- Train machine learning models incrementally.
- Monitor model performance using streaming metrics.
- Visualise model performance over time.

The notebook uses NumPy and the custom NumCompute streaming modules.

import numpy as np

from numcompute.io import load_csv_chunks

from numcompute_stream.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier
from numcompute_stream.preprocessing import StandardScaler
from numcompute_stream.pipeline import Pipeline

